        "cooked": "<p>Why has our newest face not had a thread of welcome yet?</p>\n<p>I demand someone rectify this!</p>\n<p>…</p>\n<p>Oh. I seem to have done that</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Hello Maggie!</p>\n<p>I hope you didn't lose too much sanity passing the initiation rites to join the team, or I hope you lost just enough to fit in with the others.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><font size=\"9\">Maggie’s introduction was in the OblivAeon kickstarter updates <a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/gtgames/sentinels-of-the-multiverse-oblivaeon/posts/2082782\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">here</a>, not the blog posts.</font></p>",
